@startuml
title Выполнение команды управления устройством

actor User as "Пользователь"
participant MobileApp as "Mobile App"
participant APIGateway as "API Gateway"
participant UserManagement as "User Management\nComponent"
participant DeviceManagement as "Device Management\nComponent"
participant MessageBroker as "Message Broker\n(Kafka)"
participant IoTGateway as "IoT Gateway"
participant SmartDevice as "Smart Device"
participant ScenarioEngine as "Scenario Engine\nComponent"
participant NotificationComponent as "Notification\nComponent"
participant TelemetryComponent as "Telemetry\nComponent"

User -> MobileApp: Нажимает "Включить свет"
MobileApp -> APIGateway: POST /api/devices/{id}/commands\n{"action": "turn_on", "brightness": 80}

APIGateway -> UserManagement: Validate user token
UserManagement -> APIGateway: User authenticated

APIGateway -> DeviceManagement: Forward command request
DeviceManagement -> DeviceManagement: Validate command parameters
DeviceManagement -> DeviceManagement: Check device exists and is online

alt Device available
    DeviceManagement -> IoTGateway: Send device command via WebSocket\n{"deviceId": "light_001", "action": "turn_on", "brightness": 80}
    IoTGateway -> SmartDevice: Execute command via Zigbee/Z-Wave
    SmartDevice -> IoTGateway: Command executed, return new state
    IoTGateway -> DeviceManagement: Device state updated via WebSocket

    DeviceManagement -> DeviceManagement: Update device state in PostgreSQL
    DeviceManagement -> APIGateway: Success response\n{"status": "success", "new_state": {...}}

    ' Publish event to message broker
    DeviceManagement -> MessageBroker: Publish device state changed event\n{"eventType": "DEVICE_STATE_CHANGED", "deviceId": "light_001", ...}

    APIGateway -> MobileApp: 200 OK {"status": "success", "new_state": {...}}
    MobileApp -> User: Показать "Свет включён"

    ' Asynchronous event processing
    MessageBroker -> ScenarioEngine: Device state changed event
    ScenarioEngine -> ScenarioEngine: Check automation rules\nfor this device change

    alt Automation rule triggered
        ScenarioEngine -> DeviceManagement: Execute automated command\n(e.g., close the curtains)
        ScenarioEngine -> MessageBroker: Publish scenario executed event
    end

    MessageBroker -> NotificationComponent: Device state changed event
    NotificationComponent -> NotificationComponent: Check user notification preferences

    alt User wants notifications
        NotificationComponent -> User: Send push notification\n"Light turned on in Living Room"
    end

else Device offline or error
    DeviceManagement -> APIGateway: Error response\n{"status": "error", "message": "Device offline"}
    APIGateway -> MobileApp: 400 Bad Request
    MobileApp -> User: Показать "Устройство недоступно"

    DeviceManagement -> MessageBroker: Publish device error event
    MessageBroker -> NotificationComponent: Device error event
    NotificationComponent -> User: Send error notification
end

' Telemetry collection (happens independently)
SmartDevice -> IoTGateway: Send telemetry data\n(power consumption, status)
IoTGateway -> TelemetryComponent: Forward telemetry via WebSocket
TelemetryComponent -> TelemetryComponent: Store telemetry in PostgreSQL
TelemetryComponent -> MessageBroker: Publish telemetry event\n(if threshold exceeded)

@enduml